flowchart TB

User[Citizens / NGOs / Local Admins]

UI[Web / Mobile Interface<br/>Chat + Upload]

API[FastAPI Backend<br/>Query & Session Manager]

Ingest[Document Ingestion]
Extract[Text Extraction]
Chunk[Chunking & Preprocessing]
Embed[Embedding Generator]

VDB[(ChromaDB<br/>Vector Store)]

Retrieve[Semantic Retrieval Engine]

Bedrock[AWS Bedrock<br/>Claude / Titan]

Response[Source-Cited AI Response]

IAM[AWS IAM<br/>Security & Access Control]

User --> UI
UI --> API

API --> Ingest
Ingest --> Extract
Extract --> Chunk
Chunk --> Embed
Embed --> VDB

API --> Retrieve
Retrieve --> VDB
VDB --> Retrieve

Retrieve --> Bedrock
Bedrock --> Response
Response --> API
API --> UI

IAM -.-> Bedrock
